  "title": "How to Package and Sell Solar Repowering Services",
  "summary": "Solar repowering is easier to sell when homeowners understand the outcome, not just the equipment being replaced. Clear service packages help simplify complex upgrade decisions by connecting each option to production, performance, reliability, and future energy goals. A tiered approach allows installers to serve different budgets and system needs while creating natural opportunities for batteries, monitoring, optimization, and future expansion. Tigo gives installers the flexibility to build repowering packages around the existing system, rather than forcing every homeowner into a complete replacement.",
